# Welcome to "Modpack Assembly Season 1!"
This is a _"Garage-sink"_ type modpack (like "_kitchen-sink"_, but more chaotic) that aims to transform Minecraft into pure chaos, where you have no idea on what is going on!
![A lot of GregTech machines on a copper platform, a copper Dimensional door, some blocks for spell creation and a giant mechanical monster sitting on top](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d88f621fbbe728e21a21178a703ce7bba6a6519d.png)
It was created my asking many different people for mods, without telling them what mods were already in the modpack.
## It containes:
- **GregTechCEu Modern** - cool tech mod which adds cool machines;
- **Irons Spells and Spellbooks** - cool magic mod;
- **Pams Harvestcraft 2** - adds different crops and foods;
- **Biomancy** - _flesh_;
- **Create** - very popular tech mod (how well does it work with GTCEuM? I dont know :D);
- **Botania** - a techno-magic mod based on botany;
- **Enigmatic Legacy** - adds cool artifacts that may add more difficulty to the pack;
- **L_Ender's Cataclysm** - cool bosses;
- **Tetra** - modular tools;
- **Minecolonies** - create your own town, and tax them! (or dont);
- **Themal Series** - a tech mod that realy shouldn't be here;
- **No Terra Firma Craft** - please stop suggesting it, the mod *will* break the pack.

And many more!

## Credits:
Pamela Collins (MatrexsVigil) and Rhodox of the Painterly Pack for making the "Pam's Harvestcarft 2" mod;
Amazing people from discord chanels Create: Aeronautics, Mickelus' Mods, CoFH and Alex's Mods!
